*

# Un-ignore all directories so Git can traverse them  
!**/

!.gitignore

!.obsidian
!.obsidian/**

!09 Templates
!09 Templates/**

!_MOC_Tasks.md

# Obsidian workspace state (local per machine)
.obsidian/workspace.json

# Folder view configuration files
*/.DS_Store
*/Desktop.ini

# Thumbnail cache files
._*
*/Thumbs.db

# Files that might appear on external disks
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# Obsidian text extractor cache (local per machine)
.obsidian/plugins/text-extractor/cache

# Obsidian mobile workspace state (local per machine)
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json

# Obsidian bookmarks state (local per machine)
.obsidian/bookmarks.json

# Obsidian remember-cursor-position state (local per machine)
.obsidian/plugins/remember-cursor-position/cursor-positions.json
